Package: SIRAP
Title: Spatial Immune Receptor Analysis and Processing
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hunter J.", "Melton", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "Hunter.J.Melton@dartmouth.edu"),
    person("Chinmay", "Vaidya", role = "aut", email = "chinmay.m.vaidya.gr@dartmouth.edu")
  )
Description: Spatial Immune Receptor Analysis and Processing. How sweet is
    that? An R interface to the 'rad' command-line demultiplexer plus a
    consolidated toolkit for long-read spatial immune receptor sequencing:
    AIRR-style rearrangement tables with spatial barcodes and coordinates,
    Visium HD barcode mapping, pRESTO/IgBLAST shell pipeline generation,
    clonal summaries, Seurat clone assays, tree plotting, int64-packed DNA
    primitives, and PAF parsing utilities.
